  "bodyHash": "ccc8c1d04d65c0ba",
  "content": "<h1><strong><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1408107/description_c8a0b12a-559b-4ce5-b57a-5d231f88aeff.png\" alt=\"Appleskin pack icon\" width=\"170\" height=\"170\"></strong></h1>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>想将 Sapixcraft 与&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/appleskin\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">AppleSkin</a>&nbsp;一起使用吗？</strong></h1>\n<p>如果默认的<strong>金色饱和度图标</strong>放在 Sapixcraft 饥饿条旁边显得不协调，这个补丁可以解决这个问题。</p>\n<p>此资源包将 AppleSkin 的饱和度图标替换为 Sapixcraft 风格的版本，使整体视觉效果保持一致。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2>你可以选择<strong>三种样式</strong>之一：</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>普通</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1408107/description_7401393d-8ff8-4e22-b93b-4d278276cdf4.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<ul>\n<li>橙色</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1408107/description_8231733b-b598-446b-afb7-3df6fd7bc2ad.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<ul>\n<li>渐变疲劳条</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1408107/description_49ab666b-f9f6-4792-9d39-554a7f4eeeea.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<h2><strong>加载顺序：</strong>请将此资源包放在<strong>Sapixcraft 之上</strong>。</h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1408107/description_db121dc8-fc7b-4aae-8fa8-31a939dccda0.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<hr>\n<p>此资源包专为搭配 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/sapixcraft\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Sapixcraft</strong></a> 和 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/appleskin\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>AppleSkin</strong></a> 使用而设计。</p>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
